 final room, he uncovers scattered clues to the estate's history and to the wider world beyond it, a low-fantasy realm where airships are commonplace and old secrets run deep. Those clues gradually point toward a more personal mystery: the disappearance of Simon's mother, the children's book author Mary Jones.", "summary": "Welcome to Mt. Holly, where every dawn unveils a new mystery. Navigate through shifting corridors and ever-changing chambers in this genre-defying strategy puzzle adventure. But will the unpredictable path you create lead you to the rumored Room 46?", "themes": [{"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/blue-prince", "videos": [{"id": 109768, "name": "Reveal Trailer", "video_id": "BVvcRH3Mbtk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BVvcRH3Mbtk", "title": "Blue Prince Reveal Trailer - Future Games Show Spring Showcase 2024", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BVvcRH3Mbtk/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 115992, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "1Tchw3O9UXc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1Tchw3O9UXc", "title": "Blue Prince Trailer - PC Gaming Show 2024", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1Tchw3O9UXc/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 140217, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Kwq7O2nLK1U"}, {"id": 134676, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "GoOcOTwmhbg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GoOcOTwmhbg", "title": "Blue Prince Trailer \u2013 The PC Gaming Show: Most Wanted 2024", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GoOcOTwmhbg/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 134788, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "SxT2jjn2yZ8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SxT2jjn2yZ8", "title": "Blue Prince Release Window Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SxT2jjn2yZ8/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 141253, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "1qrSIlGSVeM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1qrSIlGSVeM", "title": "Blue Prince - Official Narrative Trailer | ID@Xbox", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1qrSIlGSVeM/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 14565